  "bio": "Delve into the monochromatic mastery of 'Creative Arts Burnley,' a distinguished tattoo studio nestled in the heart of Burnley, United Kingdom. Specializing in black and gray tattoo artistry, this space transcends the ordinary, merging a cutting-edge tattoo studio with an immersive art gallery ambiance, where the works of @art_by_cain and @danny_tattooart come to life on skin and canvas alike.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Burnley, England, United Kingdom\n\n& 🅰🆁🆃 🅶🅰🅻🅻🅴🆁🆈\n➖➖➖➖➖➖➖\n𝚃𝚊𝚝𝚝𝚘𝚘 𝚂𝚝𝚞𝚍𝚒𝚘 & 𝙰𝚛𝚝 𝙶𝚊𝚕𝚕𝚎𝚛𝚢 𝚒𝚗 𝙱𝚞𝚛𝚗𝚕𝚎𝚢\n➖➖➖➖➖➖➖\n@art_by_cain",
